 ir at a wealthy school. Director Miki Magasiva and subject Beulah Koale sc
 heduled to attend. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/tina\n\n
 Also playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Downtown (Mon 19 May\, 6:00 PM)
